    "body": "This is surprising to me that the new fit is changing LR by 60%. When I had ablated the MuonH LR individually, the old LR had seemed better than +-30%. The architecture has seen a couple changes since then such as normalizing the contribution of the routed experts. I'll rerun these sizes under the new LR and see if it performs better.",
